  "title": "Baked Slow Cooker Chicken",
  "description": "Cook chicken in the crockpot to tender, juicy perfection. A pinch of paprika boosts flavor and adds a golden brown finish to this slow cooker version of baked chicken.",
  "authors": [
    "'Cotton' Couch"
